# Concept channelNumber
#
# Maps (satelliteSeries, satelliteNumber, instrumentType, scaledValueOfCentralWaveNumber)
# to the standard instrument channel number.
#
# Source tables:
#   satelliteSeries  -> BUFR Code Table 0 02 020 (Common Code Table C-5)
#   satelliteNumber  -> BUFR Code Table 0 01 007 (Common Code Table C-5)
#   instrumentType   -> BUFR Code Table 0 02 019 (Common Code Table C-8)
#
# Channel numbering follows each instrument's standard convention.
# Wave number is in m^-1 (with scaleFactorOfCentralWaveNumber typically 0).
#   wavelength (um) = 1e6 / scaledValueOfCentralWaveNumber
#
# In case of a repeated entry:
#  set uses the FIRST one
#  get returns the LAST match

# ==========================================================================
# SEVIRI - Spinning Enhanced Visible and Infrared Imager (instrumentType=207)
# On MSG satellites (satelliteSeries=333): METEOSAT-8(55), -9(56), -10(57), -11(70)
